{
 "encounter_id": "00765",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "CAREGIVER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Morning, doctor. I'm Ellie, Mr Rowe's carer. He's had the runs since the camping trip, and I can't get him to eat."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks, Ellie. Mr Rowe, how long have you had the diarrhoea?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four days. Since Saturday."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "It's ten days, Mr Rowe. You told me the day after we got back from the lakes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So four days from you and ten from Ellie. I'll put it down as four to ten days. How often are you going?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Five, six times a day. Watery."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you been sick? Any vomiting?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Not sick."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He was sick on the Sunday, twice, in the tent. I held the bucket."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll note that you each said different things about that. Any blood in the stool, or black stools?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hot and cold, a bit. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Where did you get your drinking water, on the trip? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "From the stream, boiled. Most of the time. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Not always boiled, I think. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Any health conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Type 2 diabetes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anyone in the family with bowel problems?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My brother has colitis."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your numbers. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go on. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 92, blood pressure 118 over 70, temperature 37.8, oxygen 97 percent, weight 74 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is he dry? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A little. Mr Rowe, I'll press your tummy.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ow. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Soft, with some tenderness around the belly button, no guarding, and your mouth is a little dry."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Does he need to go to hospital? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not at this stage. Persistent diarrhoea after drinking stream water makes me think of a parasite, giardia, but I'm not going to put a name on it until we test."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like you to bring a stool sample, in the pot I'll give you, so we can test for infections."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll make sure he does it tomorrow. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Drink lots of water with a pinch of salt and sugar, little and often, and eat plain food."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "As you have diabetes, check your sugars more often while you're unwell."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll remind him. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in a week, with the results."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A week. Aye. ~"
  }
 ],
